{"seq":2,"slug":"signals-behaviors-events","title":"信号、行为与事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/foundations/signals-behaviors-events","wordCount":531,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"信号-行为与事件\">信号、行为与事件</h1><p>FRP 的三个核心抽象——Signal（信号）、Behavior（行为）、Event（事件）——构成了描述随时间变化的计算的完整词汇表。理解它们的精确语义是正确使用任何 FRP 系统的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Signal</strong> 是 Behavior 的另一种称法，两者在文献中通用。严格定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"type Time = Double  -- 连续时间（实数）&#10;&#10;-- Behavior: 在任意时刻都有值的连续函数&#10;newtype Behavior a = Behavior { at :: Time -&gt; a }&#10;&#10;-- Event: 有限或无限的带时间戳的值序列&#10;newtype Event a = Event { occurrences :: [(Time, a)] }&#10;-- 约束：时间戳单调递增&#10;&#10;-- Signal 是 Behavior 的通俗称法&#10;type Signal a = Behavior a\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Time = Double  -- 连续时间（实数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Behavior: 在任意时刻都有值的连续函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>newtype Behavior a = Behavior { at :: Time -> a }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Event: 有限或无限的带时间戳的值序列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>newtype Event a = Event { occurrences :: [(Time, a)] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 约束：时间戳单调递增</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Signal 是 Behavior 的通俗称法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Signal a = Behavior a</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两者的关键区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Behavior</th>\n<th>Event</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间性</td>\n<td><strong>连续</strong>：每个时刻都有值</td>\n<td><strong>离散</strong>：只在特定时刻发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样</td>\n<td>可在任意 t 处求值</td>\n<td>不可&quot;查询&quot;，只能监听</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存语义</td>\n<td>当前值</td>\n<td>过去所有发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>示例</td>\n<td>鼠标位置、温度、进度条</td>\n<td>点击、键盘输入、定时器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Time&#10;    participant Behavior as Behavior(连续)&#10;    participant Event as Event(离散)&#10;&#10;    Time-&gt;&gt;Behavior: t=0.0 → query → 42.0&#10;    Time-&gt;&gt;Behavior: t=0.5 → query → 44.5&#10;    Time-&gt;&gt;Behavior: t=1.0 → query → 49.0&#10;    Time-&gt;&gt;Event: t=0.3 → occurrence: &quot;click&quot;&#10;    Time-&gt;&gt;Event: t=0.8 → occurrence: &quot;click&quot;&#10;    Note over Event: t=0.0, 0.5, 1.0 无发生\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Time\n    participant Behavior as Behavior(连续)\n    participant Event as Event(离散)\n\n    Time-&gt;&gt;Behavior: t=0.0 → query → 42.0\n    Time-&gt;&gt;Behavior: t=0.5 → query → 44.5\n    Time-&gt;&gt;Behavior: t=1.0 → query → 49.0\n    Time-&gt;&gt;Event: t=0.3 → occurrence: \"click\"\n    Time-&gt;&gt;Event: t=0.8 → occurrence: \"click\"\n    Note over Event: t=0.0, 0.5, 1.0 无发生</pre><h2 id=\"behavior-的操作语义\">Behavior 的操作语义</h2><p>Behavior 支持函子（Functor）、应用函子（Applicative）操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- Functor: 对 Behavior 中的每个值应用函数&#10;fmap :: (a -&gt; b) -&gt; Behavior a -&gt; Behavior b&#10;fmap f (Behavior b) = Behavior (\\t -&gt; f (b t))&#10;&#10;-- Applicative: 组合多个 Behavior&#10;liftA2 :: (a -&gt; b -&gt; c) -&gt; Behavior a -&gt; Behavior b -&gt; Behavior c&#10;liftA2 f (Behavior a) (Behavior b) = Behavior (\\t -&gt; f (a t) (b t))&#10;&#10;-- 示例：位置 = 速度 × 时间&#10;position :: Behavior Float&#10;position = liftA2 (*) velocity (Behavior id)&#10;&#10;-- integral: Behavior 积分（通过数值离散化实现）&#10;integral :: Behavior Float -&gt; Behavior Float&#10;integral (Behavior b) = Behavior (\\t -&gt; numericalIntegral b 0 t)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Functor: 对 Behavior 中的每个值应用函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fmap :: (a -> b) -> Behavior a -> Behavior b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fmap f (Behavior b) = Behavior (\\t -> f (b t))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Applicative: 组合多个 Behavior</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>liftA2 :: (a -> b -> c) -> Behavior a -> Behavior b -> Behavior c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>liftA2 f (Behavior a) (Behavior b) = Behavior (\\t -> f (a t) (b t))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 示例：位置 = 速度 × 时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>position :: Behavior Float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>position = liftA2 (*) velocity (Behavior id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- integral: Behavior 积分（通过数值离散化实现）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>integral :: Behavior Float -> Behavior Float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>integral (Behavior b) = Behavior (\\t -> numericalIntegral b 0 t)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在工业 FRP（RxJS/Reactor）中，Behavior 对应 <strong>BehaviorSubject</strong>（RxJS）或 <strong>StateFlow</strong>（Kotlin）——它们始终持有一个当前值，新订阅者立即收到最新值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// RxJS 中的 Behavior 模拟&#10;import { BehaviorSubject, combineLatest, map } from &#39;rxjs&#39;;&#10;&#10;const mouseX$ = new BehaviorSubject&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;const mouseY$ = new BehaviorSubject&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;&#10;// 组合两个 Behavior：计算到原点的距离&#10;const distance$ = combineLatest([mouseX$, mouseY$]).pipe(map(([x, y]) =&gt; Math.sqrt(x * x + y * y)));&#10;&#10;document.addEventListener(&#39;mousemove&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;  mouseX$.next(e.clientX);&#10;  mouseY$.next(e.clientY);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// RxJS 中的 Behavior 模拟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { BehaviorSubject, combineLatest, map } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rxjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mouseX$</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BehaviorSubject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mouseY$</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BehaviorSubject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 组合两个 Behavior：计算到原点的距离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> distance$</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> combineLatest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([mouseX$, mouseY$]).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(([</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mousemove'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mouseX$.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.clientX);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mouseY$.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.clientY);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"event-的操作语义\">Event 的操作语义</h2><p>Event 是时序上的单子（Monad），支持多种组合操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- merge: 合并两个 Event 流（按时间顺序交织）&#10;merge :: Event a -&gt; Event a -&gt; Event a&#10;merge (Event e1) (Event e2) = Event (mergeBy fst e1 e2)&#10;&#10;-- filter: 过滤 Event&#10;filterE :: (a -&gt; Bool) -&gt; Event a -&gt; Event a&#10;filterE p (Event e) = Event (filter (p . snd) e)&#10;&#10;-- snapshot: 用 Event 触发时的时间点采样 Behavior&#10;snapshot :: Event a -&gt; Behavior b -&gt; Event (a, b)&#10;snapshot (Event e) (Behavior b) = Event (map (\\(t, a) -&gt; (t, (a, b t))) e)&#10;&#10;-- accumulate: 用 Event 驱动状态累积（类似 fold）&#10;accumE :: b -&gt; Event (b -&gt; b) -&gt; Behavior b\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- merge: 合并两个 Event 流（按时间顺序交织）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>merge :: Event a -> Event a -> Event a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>merge (Event e1) (Event e2) = Event (mergeBy fst e1 e2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- filter: 过滤 Event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>filterE :: (a -> Bool) -> Event a -> Event a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>filterE p (Event e) = Event (filter (p . snd) e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- snapshot: 用 Event 触发时的时间点采样 Behavior</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>snapshot :: Event a -> Behavior b -> Event (a, b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>snapshot (Event e) (Behavior b) = Event (map (\\(t, a) -> (t, (a, b t))) e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- accumulate: 用 Event 驱动状态累积（类似 fold）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>accumE :: b -> Event (b -> b) -> Behavior b</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// RxJS 中的 Event 操作&#10;import { Subject, merge, filter } from &#39;rxjs&#39;;&#10;&#10;const keydown$ = new Subject&lt;KeyboardEvent&gt;();&#10;const click$ = new Subject&lt;MouseEvent&gt;();&#10;&#10;// merge: 合并多种用户输入事件&#10;const userAction$ = merge(keydown$, click$);&#10;&#10;// filter: 只关注 Enter 键&#10;const enter$ = keydown$.pipe(filter((e) =&gt; e.key === &#39;Enter&#39;));&#10;&#10;// snapshot 等价（combineLatest + take(1) 模式）&#10;import { combineLatest, take } from &#39;rxjs&#39;;&#10;const submitValue$ = enter$.pipe(&#10;  // 按 Enter 时获取当前输入框的值&#10;  combineLatest([inputValue$]),&#10;  take(1),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// RxJS 中的 Event 操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Subject, merge, filter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rxjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> keydown$</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">KeyboardEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> click$</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MouseEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// merge: 合并多种用户输入事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userAction$</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(keydown$, click$);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// filter: 只关注 Enter 键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enter$</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> keydown$.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Enter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// snapshot 等价（combineLatest + take(1) 模式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { combineLatest, take } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rxjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> submitValue$</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enter$.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 按 Enter 时获取当前输入框的值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  combineLatest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([inputValue$]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  take</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"switcher-动态切换信号\">Switcher：动态切换信号</h2><p><code>switcher</code> 是 FRP 中处理&quot;结构可变的数据流网络&quot;的核心原语——允许根据事件动态切换当前活跃的 Behavior：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- switcher: 初始 Behavior，每当 Event 发生时切换到新 Behavior&#10;switcher :: Behavior a -&gt; Event (Behavior a) -&gt; Behavior a&#10;switcher b0 (Event switchEvents) = Behavior (\\t -&gt;&#10;  let activeB = last (b0 : map snd (filter (\\(st, _) -&gt; st &lt;= t) switchEvents))&#10;  in activeB `at` t)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- switcher: 初始 Behavior，每当 Event 发生时切换到新 Behavior</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>switcher :: Behavior a -> Event (Behavior a) -> Behavior a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>switcher b0 (Event switchEvents) = Behavior (\\t -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let activeB = last (b0 : map snd (filter (\\(st, _) -> st &#x3C;= t) switchEvents))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  in activeB `at` t)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型用例：游戏中角色状态机（Idle → Walking → Jumping）每个状态都是独立的 Behavior：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 角色控制&#10;characterBehavior :: Behavior CharacterState&#10;characterBehavior = switcher idleBehavior stateTransitions&#10;  where&#10;    stateTransitions = merge&#10;      (jumpPress `snapshot` const jumpBehavior)&#10;      (landEvent  `snapshot` const walkBehavior)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 角色控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>characterBehavior :: Behavior CharacterState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>characterBehavior = switcher idleBehavior stateTransitions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stateTransitions = merge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (jumpPress `snapshot` const jumpBehavior)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (landEvent  `snapshot` const walkBehavior)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在工业 FRP 中，<code>switcher</code> 对应 RxJS 的 <code>switchMap</code>、Reactor 的 <code>switchOnNext</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// switchMap: 每当高阶流发出新 Observable 时，取消旧的，订阅新的&#10;import { switchMap } from &#39;rxjs&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 搜索框：每次新输入取消上一次请求&#10;const searchResults$ = searchInput$.pipe(switchMap((query) =&gt; fetchSearchResults(query)));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// switchMap: 每当高阶流发出新 Observable 时，取消旧的，订阅新的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { switchMap } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rxjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 搜索框：每次新输入取消上一次请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> searchResults$</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> searchInput$.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">switchMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchSearchResults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query)));</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时间函数的语义精确性\">时间函数的语义精确性</h2><p>FRP 的时间语义确保了以下等式在数学上成立：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"-- 时间变换的等式定律&#10;fmap f (fmap g b) = fmap (f . g) b        -- Functor 组合律&#10;integral (fmap (+ c) b) = integral b + c * time  -- 积分线性性&#10;snapshot (filterE p e) b = filterE (p . fst) (snapshot e b)  -- 过滤与采样的交换律\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 时间变换的等式定律</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fmap f (fmap g b) = fmap (f . g) b        -- Functor 组合律</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>integral (fmap (+ c) b) = integral b + c * time  -- 积分线性性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>snapshot (filterE p e) b = filterE (p . fst) (snapshot e b)  -- 过滤与采样的交换律</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这些定律使 FRP 程序可以像数学公式一样被化简和优化——这是命令式回调代码完全无法做到的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Behavior</strong> = 连续时间函数 <code>Time → a</code>，任意时刻可查询；对应 RxJS <code>BehaviorSubject</code>、Kotlin <code>StateFlow</code></li>\n<li><strong>Event</strong> = 离散时间序列 <code>[(Time, a)]</code>，只在特定时刻发生；对应 RxJS <code>Subject</code></li>\n<li><strong>Signal</strong> 是 Behavior 的别名，两者指同一概念</li>\n<li><strong>Switcher</strong> 用 Event 动态切换活跃的 Behavior，是处理时变信号图的核心原语；工业对应 <code>switchMap</code></li>\n<li>FRP 的等式定律使程序具备数学推理能力，是其与&quot;回调式响应编程&quot;的根本区别</li>\n<li>工业实现（RxJS/Reactor）只保留了离散 Event 流，用 BehaviorSubject/StateFlow 模拟 Behavior</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((信号/行为/事件))&#10;    Behavior&#10;      连续函数&#10;      任意时刻查询&#10;      BehaviorSubject&#10;      StateFlow&#10;    Event&#10;      离散序列&#10;      时间戳有序&#10;      Subject&#10;    Switcher&#10;      动态切换&#10;      switchMap&#10;      结构可变流图&#10;    等式定律&#10;      Functor律&#10;      积分线性性&#10;      形式化推理\">mindmap\n  root((信号/行为/事件))\n    Behavior\n      连续函数\n      任意时刻查询\n      BehaviorSubject\n      StateFlow\n    Event\n      离散序列\n      时间戳有序\n      Subject\n    Switcher\n      动态切换\n      switchMap\n      结构可变流图\n    等式定律\n      Functor律\n      积分线性性\n      形式化推理</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"信号、行为与事件","id":"信号-行为与事件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Behavior 的操作语义","id":"behavior-的操作语义"},{"level":2,"text":"Event 的操作语义","id":"event-的操作语义"},{"level":2,"text":"Switcher：动态切换信号","id":"switcher-动态切换信号"},{"level":2,"text":"时间函数的语义精确性","id":"时间函数的语义精确性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"FRP 核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/foundations/frp-core-concepts"},"next":{"title":"Reactive Streams 规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/foundations/reactive-streams-spec"}}